From 64eb6f62a890654246ed1c3c3d17b1394b99ec60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SergiioB <119968745+SergiioB@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:16:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] sycl : peer-store allreduce mode (GGML_SYCL_TP_P2P=2)

Each GPU stores its F32 partial into the peer's inbox and raises a flag that
the peer polls in its add kernel. No cross-queue events, no host wait.
---
 docs/backend/SYCL.md             |   2 +-
 ggml/src/ggml-sycl/ggml-sycl.cpp | 112 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 108 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

